---
// About.astro
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 bg-slate-800">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-16">
    <!-- Text -->
    <div class="flex-1 space-y-4 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-lg">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-accent mb-6">About Me</h2>
      <p>
        I graduated from USC's Viterbi School of Engineering with a B.S. in Computer Science
        and Business Administration. I chose to pursue a dual degree because I had an interest
        in both building cool things and understanding their application in the business world.
      </p>
      <p>
        At Microsoft, I interned as a software engineer on the Teams platform, working in
        performance-critical infrastructure serving 1M+ calls a day.
        That's where I built a strong technical foundation by learning what
        developing production-ready code really demands.
      </p>
      <p>
        Currently, I'm a technology strategy consultant at Strategy&amp;,
        advising private equity firms on technical due diligence and value creation initatives.
        Each engagement is an opportunity to analyze the technology profile of a company and identify
        where tech can be applied to improve the business.
      </p>
      <p>
        In my free time I enjoy playing poker, soccer, and video games. I also like
        building fun personal projects that combine my interests in technology and business.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Logo column -->
    <!-- To swap in real images, replace the inner <div> placeholder with: <img src="/assets/FILENAME" alt="LABEL" class="w-full h-full object-contain p-3" /> -->
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6 flex-shrink-0">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
        <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-xl bg-slate-700 border border-slate-600 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
          <img src="/assets/usc_logo2.png" alt="USC" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">USC</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
        <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-xl bg-slate-700 border border-slate-600 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
          <img src="/assets/strategy&_logo.jpeg" alt="Strategy&" class="w-[120%] h-[120%] object-cover" />
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Strategy&amp;</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
        <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-xl bg-slate-700 border border-slate-600 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
          <img src="/assets/ms_logo.png" alt="Microsoft" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Microsoft</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
        <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-xl bg-slate-700 border border-slate-600 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
          <img src="/assets/poker_icon3.jpg" alt="Poker" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Poker</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
